// Qwen0.8 tool output spells Python Boolean scalars True/False. The selected
// revision invokes this adapter before native tools.parse_xml. Prove the
// declared top-level Boolean property before lowercasing its scalar token;
// opaque string/container bodies and all framing bytes remain unchanged.
// Schemas are the admitted original OpenAI tools array. Null schemas are
// outside that domain and pass unchanged to the native validation authority.
func.decl @text.at(%text: buffer, %position: offset, %marker: buffer) -> (i1)

func.decl @text.range(%text: buffer, %begin: i64, %length: i64) -> (buffer)

